tAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Kl8OwF1Sx8_3HZV29__Ai","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"LSXRlObomsCG8Gc61khUg","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10730,"y":5030},"width":1680,"height":885,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"💡 Beispiel: Projekt- und Zeitplanung im Einsatz\n\n🎯 Wofür: Das Board zeigt, wie ein Team Themen sammelt und auf einer Zeitachse mit Entwürfen, Feedbackrunden und Tests plant.\n\n1. Links: Themenspeicher (Issues)\nHier landen offene Fragen und Ideen, z. B. „Kanban or Scrum?\" oder „diverse test groups\".\n\n2. Rechts: Zeitachse (Timeline)\nPhasen wie Start, 1. Entwurf, Feedbackrunden, 2. Entwurf und Testing liegen auf der Achse. Kreise zeigen Kennzahlen, z. B. Anzahl Teilnehmende.\n\n3. Namenskarten\nZeigen, wer wofür zuständig ist. Karten wandern vom Themenspeicher auf die Zeitachse, sobald sie eingeplant sind.\n\n🛠️ Ihre Rolle als Moderator\nÜbersetzer: Erklären Sie anhand des Beispiels, wie aus losen Themen ein Plan wird.\nErmutiger: Starten Sie für Ihr eigenes Projekt mit der Vorlage „Project Timeline\".","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Kl8OwF1Sx8_3HZV29__Ai","textSize":30,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"gXIT137sLaJsyf9vUo3jw","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12630,"y":4860},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T22 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"Ga_d5cPxzWYjDq0uskLas","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12630,"y":5000},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T22   ·   Datei: T22_project-planning-beispiel.de.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Beispiele.nwb › Rahmen 2\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"wRwZBJF1NZxTtQxsT9E74","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12630,"y":5150},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"FA_lTRfmBPdImXPquSKkU","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13080,"y":5150},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"9YKOZfAo-NaWonv1WDPA5","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13790,"y":5150},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"ji_V7dZxhCWqK8whmRbFq","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12630,"y":5218},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"8hs6SLdjQ6avYO5K72Fk6","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13080,"y":5218},"width":690,"height":93,"fillColor":"#e6e6e6","text":"optional, als Beispiel","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000","textItalic":true},{"id":"j4W-JjADI6y7rzsWSlnFy","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13790,"y":5218},"width":760,"height":93,"fillColor":"#ffface","text":"","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"Y2AITNsUN226viCFT62v3","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"VEeFCgJyJHcCALJI2T2hf","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12630,"y":5319}